841999999999994}, {"name": "test_rag_quality[openai:gpt-5.6-luna-Compare current/non-current asset, liability, and equity changes incl. deferred tax assets/liabilities, 2023\\u20132024.-Between December 31, 2023, and December 31, 2024:\\n\\n**Current Assets** increased from $309,057 to $368,821, mainly due to higher cash and cash equivalents (up $76,599) and trade/other receivables (up $2,204), partially offset by lower inventories (down $1,166) and other financial assets (down $12,599).\\n\\n**Non-Current Assets** remained relatively stable, moving from $1,667,298 to $1,610,967. Key changes include an increase in mining interests (up $35,687), a decrease in property, plant, and equipment (down $27,664), and a drop in deferred tax assets (down $42,357).\\n\\n**Total Assets** stayed stable, rising slightly from $1,976,355 to $1,979,788.\\n\\n**Current Liabilities** increased from $120,138 to $144,307, driven mainly by higher trade and other payables (up $9,482) and income taxes payable (up $17,570).\\n\\n**Non-Current Liabilities** grew from $498,097 to $484,410. Notable movements include a decrease in debt facilities (down $10,323), a decrease in lease liabilities (down $8,012), and an increase in decommissioning liabilities (up $7,503).\\n\\n**Total Liabilities** rose from $618,235 to $628,717.\\n\\n**Equity** decreased from $1,358,120 to $1,351,071. This reflects an increase in share capital (up $98,130) and equity reserves (up $2,003), offset by a higher accumulated deficit (increase of $107,182).\\n\\n**Deferred Tax Assets** dropped from $88,732 to $46,375, while **Deferred Tax Liabilities** increased slightly from $79,017 to $80,094.\\n\\n**Summary:**  \\n- Current assets and liabilities increased.  \\n- Non-current asset and liability changes varied by category.  \\n- Total assets and liabilities were relatively stable, but equity declined due to the increased deficit.  \\n- Deferred tax assets decreased significantly; deferred tax liabilities grew slightly.-| | Note | December 31, 2024 | December 31, 2023 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| **Assets** | | | |\\n| **Current assets** | | | |\\n| Cash and cash equivalents | | $202,180 | $125,581 |\\n| Trade and other receivables | | 12,303 | 10,099 |\\n| Value added taxes receivable | 26(c) | 33,864 | 38,587 |\\n| Inventories | 12 | 62,524 | 63,690 |\\n| Other financial assets | 13 | 49,781 | 62,380 |\\n| Prepaid expenses and other | | 8,169 | 8,720 |\\n| **Total current assets** | | **368,821** | **309,057** |\\n| **Non-current assets** | | | |\\n| Mining interests | 15 | 1,034,522 | 998,835 |\\n| Property, plant and equipment | 16 | 378,630 | 406,294 |\\n| Right-of-use assets | 17 | 23,898 | 27,284 |\\n| Deposits on non-current assets | | 5,720 | 6,430 |\\n| Trade and other receivables | | 5,000 | \\u2014 |\\n| Non-current restricted cash | 19 | 106,072 | 125,573 |\\n| Non-current value added taxes receivable | 26(c) | 10,750 | 14,150 |\\n| Deferred tax assets | 24 | 46,375 | 88,732 |\\n| **Total assets** | | **$1,979,788** | **$1,976,355** |\\n| **Liabilities and Equity** | | | |\\n| **Current liabilities** | | | |\\n| Trade and other payables | 20 | $103,895 | $94,413 |\\n| Unearned revenue | 5 | 580 | 2,301 |\\n| Current portion of debt facilities | 21 | 825 | 832 |\\n| Current portion of lease liabilities | 22 | 16,215 | 17,370 |\\n| Income taxes payable | 24 | 22,792 | 5,222 |\\n| **Total current liabilities** | | **144,307** | **120,138** |\\n| **Non-current liabilities** | | | |\\n| Debt facilities | 21 | 208,657 | 218,980 |\\n| Lease liabilities | 22 | 11,320 | 19,332 |\\n| Decommissioning liabilities | 23 | 159,067 | 151,564 |\\n| Other liabilities | | 5,587 | 5,592 |\\n| Non-current income taxes payable | 24 | 19,685 | 23,612 |\\n| Deferred tax liabilities | 24 | 80,094 | 79,017 |\\n| **Total liabilities** | | **$628,717** | **$618,235** |\\n| **Equity** | | | |\\n| Share capital | | 1,978,101 | 1,879,971 |\\n| Equity reserves | | 90,028 | 88,025 |\\n| Accumulated deficit | | (717,058) | (609,876) |\\n| **Total equity** | | **$1,351,071** | **$1,358,120** |\\n| **Total liabilities and equity** | | **$1,979,788** | **$1,976,355** |\\n\\nAudited Consolidated Financial Statements\\n\\nThe Consolidated Statements of Financial Position provides a summary of assets, liabilities and equity, as well as their current versus non-current nature, as at the reporting date_\\n\\nPage\\n\\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF FINANCIAL POSITION\\n\\nThe accompanying notes are an integral part of the audited consolidated financial statements\\n\\nFirst Majestic Silver Corp. 2024 Annual Repor\\n\\nAS AT DECEMBER 31, 2024 AND DECEMBER 31, 2023\\n]", "input": "Compare current/non-current asset, liability, and equity changes incl. deferred tax assets/liabilities, 2023\u20132024.", "actualOutput": "### Grupo M\u00e9xico: cambios entre 2023 y 2024  \n*Millones de d\u00f3lares estadounidenses, salvo indicaci\u00f3n contraria.*\n\n| Categor\u00eda | 31-dic-2023 | 31-dic-2024 | Cambio | Cambio % |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| **Activos corrientes** | 309,057 | 368,821 | **+59,764** | **+19.3%** |\n| **Activos no corrientes*** | 1,667,298 | 1,610,967 | **\u221256,331** | **\u22123.4%** |\n| **Activos totales** | 1,976,355 | 1,979,788 | **+3,433** | **+0.2%** |\n| **Pasivos corrientes** | 120,138 | 144,307 | **+24,169** | **+20.1%** |\n| **Pasivos no corrientes*** | 498,097? | 484,410 | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| **Pasivos totales** | 618,235 | 628,717 | **+10,482** | **+1.7%** |\n| **Patrimonio total** | 1,358,120 | 1,351,071 | **\u22127,049** | **\u22120.5%** |\n\n\\*Los activos no corrientes se calculan como activos totales menos activos corrientes. Los pasivos no corrientes se calculan como pasivos totales menos pasivos corrientes. **Correcci\u00f3n:** el pasivo no corriente de 2023 es **498,097** si se usa el total de pasivos de 618,235 y pasivos corrientes de 120,138; sin embargo, la suma de las partidas no corrientes presentadas en el estado da **498,097**. Para 2024, la cifra es **484,410**.\n\n### Principales movimientos de activos\n\n- Los **activos corrientes** aumentaron $59,764, principalmente por:\n  - efectivo y equivalentes: **+$76,599**;\n  - cuentas por cobrar comerciales y otras: **+$2,204**;\n  - parcialmente compensados por menores cuentas por cobrar de IVA (**\u2212$4,723**), activos financieros (**\u2212$12,599**) e inventarios (**\u2212$1,166**) [source p.11].\n- Los **activos no corrientes** disminuyeron $56,331. Aunque los intereses mineros aumentaron $35,687, esto fue m\u00e1s que compensado por:\n  - propiedad, planta y equipo: **\u2212$27,664**;\n  - efectivo restringido no corriente: **\u2212$19,501**;\n  - activos por impuestos diferidos: **\u2212$42,357**;\n  - menores activos por IVA no corriente: **\u2212$3,400** [source p.11].\n\n### Principales movimientos de pasivos\n\n- Los **pasivos corrientes** aumentaron $24,169. El incremento m\u00e1s importante fue en impuestos sobre la renta por pagar, de $5,222 a $22,792 (**+$17,570**), seguido de cuentas por pagar comerciales y otras (**+$9,482**). Esto fue parcialmente compensado por menores ingresos diferidos y arrendamientos corrientes [source p.11].\n- Los **pasivos no corrientes** disminuyeron $13,687 sobre la base de los totales presentados. Las principales variaciones fueron:\n  - deuda no corriente: **\u2212$10,323**;\n  - pasivos por arrendamiento: **\u2212$8,012**;\n  - pasivos por desmantelamiento: **+$7,503**;\n  - pasivos por impuestos diferidos: **+$1,077** [source p.11].\n\n### Patrimonio\n\nEl patrimonio disminuy\u00f3 $7,049, de $1,358,120 a $1,351,071 [source p.11]. Sus componentes cambiaron as\u00ed:\n\n- **Capital social:** +$98,130, de $1,879,971 a $1,978,101.\n- **Reservas de capital:** +$2,003, de $88,025 a $90,028.\n- **D\u00e9ficit acumulado:** se deterior\u00f3 en $107,182, de $(609,876) a $(717,058).\n\nPor tanto, el aumento del capital social y de las reservas fue m\u00e1s que compensado por el mayor d\u00e9ficit acumulado.\n\n### Impuestos diferidos\n\n| Concepto | 2023 | 2024 | Cambio |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| **Activos por impuestos diferidos** | 88,732 | 46,375 | **\u221242,357** |\n| **Pasivos por impuestos diferidos** | 79,017 | 80,094 | **+1,077** |\n| **Posici\u00f3n neta**: activo/(pasivo) | **+9,715** | **\u221233,719** | **\u221243,434** |\n\nLa posici\u00f3n neta pas\u00f3 de un **activo neto por impuestos diferidos de $9,715** en 2023 a un **pasivo neto de $33,719** en 2024, un deterioro de $43,434 [source p.58]. En detalle, el saldo bruto de activos diferidos disminuy\u00f3 principalmente porque los activos por p\u00e9rdidas no reconocidos aumentaron, mientras que el saldo de pasivos diferidos aument\u00f3 de $126,304 a $175,513 antes de la presentaci\u00f3n compensada en el estado de situaci\u00f3n financiera [source p.58].", "expectedOutput": "Between December 31, 2023, and December 31, 2024:\n\n**Current Assets** increased from $309,057 to $368,821, mainly due to higher cash and cash equivalents (up $76,599) and trade/other receivables (up $2,204), partially offset by lower inventories (down $1,166) and other financial assets (down $12,599).\n\n**Non-Current Assets** remained relatively stable, moving from $1,667,298 to $1,610,967. Key changes include an increase in mining interests (up $35,687), a decrease in property, plant, and equipment (down $27,664), and a drop in deferred tax assets (down $42,357).\n\n**Total Assets** stayed stable, rising slightly from $1,976,355 to $1,979,788.\n\n**Current Liabilities** increased from $120,138 to $144,307, driven mainly by higher trade and other payables (up $9,482) and income taxes payable (up $17,570).\n\n**Non-Current Liabilities** grew from $498,097 to $484,410. Notable movements include a decrease in debt facilities (down $10,323), a decrease in lease liabilities (down $8,012), and an increase in decommissioning liabilities (up $7,503).\n\n**Total Liabilities** rose from $618,235 to $628,717.\n\n**Equity** decreased from $1