3, all activities at the Jerritt Canyon processing plant were fully suspended.\",\n    \"In-circuit recovery efforts at Jerritt Canyon in 2024 resulted in the recovery of 2,405 ounces of gold.\",\n    \"The company recorded an impairment charge of $125.2 million for the Jerritt Canyon operating segment in the first quarter of 2023.\",\n    \"No impairment or impairment reversal was recognized for the Jerritt Canyon segment during the year ended December 31, 2024.\",\n    \"On March 29, 2023, the company completed the sale of La Guitarra to Sierra Madre Gold and Silver Ltd. and received total consideration of $33.2 million net of transaction costs, before working capital adjustments.\",\n    \"The carrying value of La Guitarra at the time of disposal was $34.3 million, and the company recorded a loss on disposition of $1.4 million.\",\n    \"The company began accounting for the common shares received from Sierra Madre as an equity security at FVTOCI after the sale of La Guitarra.\",\n    \"On August 14, 2023, the company completed the sale of La Parrilla to Silver Storm Mining Ltd.\",\n    \"As of December 31, 2023, the assets and liabilities of La Guitarra and La Parrilla had been derecognized from the company's balance sheet.\",\n    \"The company had total assets of $1,976,355 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had total liabilities of $618,235 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had total equity of $1,358,120 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had cash and cash equivalents of $125,581 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had inventories of $63,690 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had mining interests valued at $998,835 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had property, plant and equipment valued at $406,294 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had right-of-use assets valued at $27,284 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had non-current restricted cash of $125,573 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had deferred tax assets of $88,732 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had trade and other payables of $94,413 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had unearned revenue of $2,301 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had current portion of debt facilities of $832 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had income taxes payable of $5,222 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had debt facilities of $218,980 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had decommissioning liabilities of $151,564 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had other liabilities of $5,592 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had non-current income taxes payable of $23,612 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had deferred tax liabilities of $79,017 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had share capital of $1,879,971 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had equity reserves of $88,025 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had an accumulated deficit of $609,876 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had working capital of $188,919 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had available liquidity of $313,559 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had an available undrawn revolving credit facility of $124,640 as of December 31, 2023.\",\n    \"The company had no material off-balance sheet arrangements as of June 30, 2024, other than contingent liabilities and vendor liability and interest as disclosed.\",\n    \"The company is not subject to any externally imposed capital requirements except for covenants under debt facilities and lease liabilities.\",\n    \"As of June 30, 2024, the company was in compliance with all of its debt covenants.\",\n    \"In July 2020, the company entered into a streaming agreement with First Mining to purchase 50% of the payable silver produced over the life of the Springpole Gold Project for $22.5 million in 